B.CX=new A.aG("This is a tribute to my mother, and so the password for her quiz is her last name. The password to unlock her trophy, is a word that always reconnects you with your mother.",null,B.u,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.a7q=new A.aG("Play Again",null,B.u,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.CY=new A.aG("The Enigma machine was a cipher device used by Nazi Germany during World War II to encrypt military messages. It looked like a typewriter, but inside it hid a complex system of rotors, plugboard settings, and ring settings that scrambled letters in billions of possible ways.\n\nEach time a key was pressed, the machine used its settings to substitute the letter, with the encryption changing every time. Because of this complexity, Enigma was considered unbreakable \u2014 until Allied codebreakers, most famously at Bletchley Park (including Alan Turing), managed to crack it.\n\nBreaking Enigma helped shorten the war and saved countless lives.\n\nGreat Movie: The Imitation Game",null,B.u,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
